message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "Learning ABA: Can LLMs Replicate Assumption-Based Argumentation Learning?"
authors:
  - family-names: Santella
    given-names: Carmine
    affiliation: "University of Bologna"
year: 2026
repository-code: "https://github.com/carmine559/Learning_ABA"
abstract: >-
  Experimental pipeline for an MSc thesis investigating whether large language
  models can replicate the ASP-ABAlearnB algorithm for learning Assumption-Based
  Argumentation frameworks from background knowledge and examples, with a
  stratified anonymised benchmark, gradual ABA semantics (BSAF), and a planned
  ArgLLMs+RAG extension.
